P",{},"纯度也不表示组件必须永远不变化。用户输入改变后，组件当然可以返回不同内容。它要求的是变化有明确输入和发生位置，让重新计算本身不偷偷改变业务事实。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"组件身份决定草稿保留还是重置"},"组件身份决定草稿保留还是重置"],"\n",["P",{},"React 把状态关联到渲染树中的位置和组件身份，并不是按函数名字在全局保存一份状态。下面切换两份资料时，编辑器的草稿应从新资料标题重新开始："],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"code-block","data-language":"tsx"},["DIV",{"class":"code-block__bar"},["SPAN",{},"tsx"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"code-copy"},"复制代码"]],["PRE",{"class":"hljs"},["CODE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"import"]," { useState } ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"from"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'react'"],";\n\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"type"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title class_"},"Lesson"]," = { ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"id"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-built_in"},"string"],"; ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"title"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-built_in"},"string"]," };\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"const"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"lessons"],": [",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title class_"},"Lesson"],", ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title class_"},"Lesson"],"] = [\n  { ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"id"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'form'"],", ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"title"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'HTML 表单'"]," },\n  { ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"id"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'snapshot'"],", ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-attr"},"title"],": ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'状态快照'"]," },\n];\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"function"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"Editor"],"(",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-params"},"{ lesson }: { lesson: Lesson }"],") {\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"const"]," [draft, setDraft] = ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"useState"],"(lesson.",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-property"},"title"],");\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"return"]," (\n    ",["SPAN",{"class":"language-xml"},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-tag"},"<",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-name"},"section"],">"],"\n      ",["SPAN